Output tap-cli-demo.gif
Set FontSize 14
Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 800
Set Height 500
Set Padding 32
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Type "tap campaigns list"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "tap stats"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "tap queue"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "exit"
Sleep 300ms
Enter